.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Enumerates the bits of a \fBBitIntSpan\fP according to its indexing mode\&. 

\fBWarning:\fP When the span is in \fBFlexSpanMode\&.Ring\fP, enumeration is infinite\&. Consumers must implement their own termination conditions to avoid non-returning loops\&. 

.PP
The enumerator yields live bit values\&. Mutating the underlying integer during enumeration will affect subsequent results\&. 
